            "value": "Hermes Agent 服务器尚未启用此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server state changed. Refresh and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器状态已变化，请刷新后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file exceeds the 50 MiB upload limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件超过 50 MiB 上传限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send this prompt to an agent on your Hermes Agent host. It installs Companion, keeps the Gateway key local, and prepares HTTPS access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将此提示发送给 Hermes Agent 运行服务器上的 Agent。它会安装 Companion、将 Gateway 密钥留在服务器本地，并准备 HTTPS 访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use your Lucky HTTPS URL, or install Tailscale and join the same tailnet as your Hermes Agent host. The next screen accepts either trusted HTTPS URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Lucky HTTPS 地址，或安装 Tailscale 并加入 Hermes Agent 服务器所在的同一 tailnet。下一页接受任一种可信 HTTPS 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private alternative: install Tailscale and sign in to the Hermes Agent host's tailnet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有网络方案：安装 Tailscale，并登录 Hermes Agent 服务器所在的 tailnet。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-hosted with Hermes Agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Hermes Agent 一起自托管"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the one-time pairing secret created on your Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建的一次性配对密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Companion is reachable, but its host-local Gateway credential was rejected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以连接 Companion，但服务器本地的 Gateway 凭据被拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Companion's host-local Gateway credential was rejected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Companion 的服务器本地 Gateway 凭据被拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device credential is no longer valid. Create a new pairing secret on the Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备凭据已失效。请在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建新的配对密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device was revoked. Create a new pairing secret on the Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备已被撤销。请在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建新的配对密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing secret was already used. Create a new one on the Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对密钥已被使用。请在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建新的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing secret expired. Create a new one on the Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对密钥已过期。请在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建新的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the HTTPS URL that Lucky or Tailscale proxies to Hermes Nest Companion, then enter a one-time pairing secret created on your Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 Lucky 或 Tailscale 代理到 Hermes Nest Companion 的 HTTPS 地址，然后输入在 Hermes Agent 服务器上创建的一次性配对密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect securely to Companion on your Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全连接到 Hermes Agent 服务器上的 Companion。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the setup prompt before continuing so Hermes Nest Companion and HTTPS access are configured on your Hermes Agent host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续前请复制设置提示，以便在 Hermes Agent 服务器上配置 Hermes Nest Companion 和 HTTPS 访问。"
          }
        }
      }
